      "field": "en",
      "before": "Duan Lan renewed the siege with ladders and tunnels, but after twenty days Shi Cong sallied forth, killed fifteen hundred men, and forced Lan to withdraw.",
      "after": "Duan Lan attacked Liucheng again, using flying ladders and tunnels, and kept up the siege for twenty days; Shi Cong personally led his officers and men out to strike, defeated him, and took fifteen hundred heads, and Lan then fled home.",
